        "markup": "<p>Het team van Diaboss bestaat uit kinderartsen, internisten, kinderdiabetesverpleegkundigen, diëtisten en kinderpsychologen. Maak hieronder kennis met ons!</p>\n<h3 class=\"intro\">Doktersassistenten</h3>\n<p><img src=\"?width=150&amp;height=200&amp;mode=max\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"200\" data-udi=\"umb://media/b02afe0832c94e0f9d0eca453a7ea1eb\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"?width=133&amp;height=200&amp;mode=max\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"200\" data-udi=\"umb://media/bc4de2b25088469e8f8ec35b305925e0\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"?width=133&amp;height=200&amp;mode=max\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"200\" data-udi=\"umb://media/ac2af6f14e1142db86fee9ef2657e4bc\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Mw. C.M. Günther&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Mw. A.M.M. Hexspoor&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Mw. I. Naarden – de Jonge<br><em>Doktersassistent&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Doktersassistent&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Doktersassistent en coördinator</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"?width=133&amp;height=200&amp;mode=max\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"200\" data-udi=\"umb://media/1d640ebf337a4e62a40bb5b78fab68a8\"></p>\n<p>Mw. L.B. Vriend<br><em>Doktersassistent en medisch secretaresse</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"intro\">Kinderdiabetesverpleegkundigen en verpleegkundig specialisten</h3>\n<p><img src=\"?width=150&amp;he